#### Setup Complete CI/CD Pipeline ####

    setup aws account -> 
        create an aws account
        create a EC2 ->
            ubantu OS
            m7i-flex.large (8gib RAM and 2vCPUs)
    
    connect to EC2 with MobaXtream ->
        use username as ubantu and pem key to connect 

    install jdk on EC2 ->
        Code(sudo apt update)
        Code(sudo apt install openjdk-17-jre)
    install Jenkins on EC2 ->
        code(# 1. Remove the old Jenkins repository configuration
            sudo rm -f /etc/apt/sources.list.d/jenkins.list

            # 2. Remove the old Jenkins key
            sudo rm -f /usr/share/keyrings/jenkins-keyring.asc

            # 3. Install Java 21 (required by current Jenkins)
            sudo apt update
            sudo apt install -y fontconfig openjdk-21-jre

            # 4. Add the NEW Jenkins 2026 signing key
            sudo wget -O /usr/share/keyrings/jenkins-keyring.asc \
            https://pkg.jenkins.io/debian-stable/jenkins.io-2026.key

            # 5. Add Jenkins LTS repository
            echo "deb [signed-by=/usr/share/keyrings/jenkins-keyring.asc]" \
            https://pkg.jenkins.io/debian-stable binary/ | \
            sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/jenkins.list > /dev/null

            # 6. Update repositories
            sudo apt update

            # 7. Install Jenkins
            sudo apt install -y jenkins)
    
